<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Dr. King returns six weeks after his eight-week review, just back from a two-week break with his family, the first he has taken in years. He had a video review with Dr. Lindqvist-Bankole last month, who agreed with the plan. His mood is clearly better; he enjoys reading and preaching again and sleeps about six and a half hours. He had one lapse in June, smoking three cigarettes late one night after a threatening call, and has not smoked since. He finishes twelve weeks of varenicline in about four weeks. Home readings over the past week averaged 132/84. He walks most mornings when he is at home and has cut back on fried food. He has no thoughts of harming himself. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Break</td><td>Two weeks away; first in years</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Better; PHQ-9 8</td></tr><tr><td>Smoking</td><td>One lapse of three cigarettes in June; smoke-free since</td></tr><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Average 132/84</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

